    <bpmn:task id="L4_02_A13" name="Document protocol deviation">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: 21CFR312 21CFR312.62(b) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination); E6R3 A1-2.5.3 (p. printed 13 / PDF 21); E6R3 A1-2.12.2 (p. printed 21 / PDF 29); E6R3 A1-2.12.6 (p. printed 22 / PDF 30); E6R3 A1-2.12.3 (p. printed 21 / PDF 29)
Requirements: REQ-062, REQ-063, REQ-064, REQ-065
Binding: binding-law
Jurisdiction: ICH, US
