    <bpmn:task id="L4_02_A14" name="Report deviation to sponsor">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 A1-2.11 (p. printed 21 / PDF 29); FDA-PD24 SIII.B.1 (p. printed 6; lines 194-198)
Requirements: REQ-066, REQ-067
Binding: binding-ICH
Jurisdiction: ICH, US
Deadline: per sponsor-specified timeframe (REQ-066); promptly (REQ-067)
Record: deviation report; documentation and explanation of premature unblinding
Party: investigator
Draft: DRAFT guidance
Verify: [verify] basis is draft guidance only - shown as DRAFT, never a binding step; [verify] E6(R3) does not label premature unblinding a protocol deviation; trial-specific criteria decide (R1 C13)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <ipd:trace binding="binding-ICH" jurisdiction="ICH US" deadline="per sponsor-specified timeframe (REQ-066); promptly (REQ-067)" draft="true" record="deviation report; documentation and explanation of premature unblinding" party="investigator">
